        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami avyemeye, hoshingwa ibgirizwa ry’umwami, maze rikandikwa mu vyagezwe vy’Abaperesi n’Abamedi, rikoya guhinduka, yuko Vashiti atazokwongera guseruka imbere y’umwami Ahasuwerusi; kandi n’icubahiro ciwe c’ubgamikazi agihe uwundi amurusha kwubaha. ",
          "type": "text",
