          "text": "Nukw arungika ivyete mu bihugu vyose vy’umwami, igihugu cose ukw inyandiko zaco ziri, n’ ihanga ryose uk’ ururimi rwaryo ruri, ng’umugabo wese yiganze mu rugo rwiwe, kandi ngo bavyamamaze mu ndimi z’abantu biwe uko zingana.",
